# Polished Crystal v3.2.3 GameShark .cht for Game Station dual-screen
# Built from polishedcrystal-3.2.3.sym WRAM labels (NOT for 3.1.x / other versions).
# WARNING: wrong-version codes can corrupt saves. Backup .sav first.
# Rename this file to EXACTLY match your ROM basename + .cht
#   e.g. polishedcrystal-3.2.3.gbc  ->  polishedcrystal-3.2.3.cht
# Path on SD: /gbc_cheats/<rom-basename>.cht
# Codes load DISABLED; press c in-game, enable only what you need.
# Item-slot codes overwrite bag slot 1 only (need ≥1 item already).


